# Design System - Zen Aesthetics

## Design Philosophy
**禅意留白 · 专注诵读 · 温暖极简**
- Minimalist, restrained, distraction-free with pure backgrounds
- Generous spacing and breathing room
- Experience over features, hide non-essential UI
- Warm accents, not cold/mechanical
- No autoplay animations/sounds, no decorative elements

## Color Palette

### Day Mode (Default)
```scss
--primary-color: #FF6B35;       // 赤褐色 - warm, Buddhist-inspired
--highlight-bg: #FFF3CD;        // 金黄 - wisdom/golden light
--bg-page: #F5F5F5;            // 宣纸白 - rice paper
--bg-card: #FFFFFF;             // 纯白 - pure white
--text-primary: #333333;         // 墨黑 - ink black
--text-secondary: #666666;      // 辅助文本
--text-hint: #999999;          // 提示文本
--border-color: #E0E0E0;       // 边框颜色
--divider-color: #EEEEEE;      // 分割线颜色
```

### Night Mode
```scss
--bg-page: #1A1A1A;            // 深空灰 - deep night
--bg-card: #2A2A2A;            // 禅堂灰 - meditation hall
--highlight-bg: #4A4A4A;        // 夜间高亮 - night highlight
--text-primary: #E0E0E0;       // 夜间主文本
--text-secondary: #B0B0B0;    // 夜间辅助文本
--text-hint: #808080;          // 夜间提示文本
--border-color: #3A3A3A;       // 夜间边框
--divider-color: #333333;      // 夜间分割线
```

**Usage**: Toggle dark mode by adding `.dark-mode` class to root element.

## Typography

### Font Families
```scss
--font-heading: 'Source Han Serif CN', 'Noto Serif SC', serif;  // Headers
--font-body: 'Source Han Sans CN', 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;   // Body
--font-sanskrit: 'Noto Sans Devanagari', sans-serif;            // Sanskrit
```

### Typography Scale (12 levels)
```scss
--font-size-xs: 12px;     // 0.75rem   - Small labels
--font-size-sm: 14px;     // 0.875rem  - Body text (default)
--font-size-base: 16px;   // 1rem      - Base size
--font-size-lg: 18px;     // 1.125rem  - Subheadings
--font-size-xl: 20px;     // 1.25rem   - Section titles
--font-size-2xl: 24px;    // 1.5rem    - Page titles
--font-size-3xl: 30px;    // 1.875rem  - Large headings
--font-size-4xl: 36px;    // 2.25rem   - Hero titles
--font-size-5xl: 48px;    // 3rem      - Display
--font-size-6xl: 60px;    // 3.75rem   - Hero display
--font-size-7xl: 72px;    // 4.5rem    - Extra large
--font-size-8xl: 96px;    // 6rem      - Massive
```

### Line Heights
```scss
--line-height-tight: 1.2;   // Headings
--line-height-base: 1.5;    // Body text
--line-height-loose: 1.8;   // Scripture text (breathing room)
--line-height-relaxed: 2;   // Extra breathing room
```

### Font Weights
```scss
--font-weight-light: 300;
--font-weight-normal: 400;
--font-weight-medium: 500;
--font-weight-semibold: 600;
--font-weight-bold: 700;
```

## Spacing System

Base unit: 8px

```scss
--space-1: 4px;     // 0.25rem   - Micro spacing
--space-2: 8px;     // 0.5rem    - Base spacing
--space-3: 12px;    // 0.75rem   - Small spacing
--space-4: 16px;    // 1rem      - Normal spacing
--space-5: 20px;    // 1.25rem   - Medium spacing
--space-6: 24px;    // 1.5rem    - Large spacing
--space-8: 32px;    // 2rem      - Extra large
--space-10: 48px;   // 3rem      - Section spacing
--space-12: 64px;   // 4rem      - Page spacing
```

## Border Radius

```scss
--radius-sm: 8px;    // Small elements
--radius-md: 12px;   // Cards (bookshelf)
--radius-lg: 16px;   // Statistics cards
--radius-xl: 24px;   - Large cards
--radius-full: 9999px; // Pill-shaped buttons
```

## Box Shadows

```scss
--shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
--shadow-base: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
--shadow-md: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
--shadow-lg: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
```

## Transitions

```scss
--transition-fast: 0.15s ease;
--transition-base: 0.3s ease;
--transition-slow: 0.5s ease;
```

## Component Specifications

### Bookshelf Cards
- **Radius**: 12px
- **Shadow**: Subtle (0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05))
- **Hover**: Slight lift with enhanced shadow

### Statistics Cards
- **Radius**: 16px
- **Shadow**: Soft (0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08))

### Settings Cards
- **Radius**: 12px
- **Shadow**: Minimal (0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05))

### Dictionary Popup
- **Mobile**: Bottom drawer (60% height), slides up from bottom
- **Tablet**: Intelligent bubble positioned near clicked term
- **Desktop**: Right sidebar panel (400px width), slides in from right

## Reading Content

- **Line Height**: 1.8x (for breathing room)
- **Paragraph Spacing**: 24px
- **Font Size**: 14-28px (adjustable, 2px steps)
- **Text Alignment**: Justified or left-aligned
- **Dictionary Highlight**: Golden yellow background (#FFF3CD)

## Touch Optimization

- **Minimum Tap Target**: 44px × 44px
- **Bottom Toolbar**: Easy thumb reach zone
- **Swipe Gestures**: Page navigation

## Accessibility

- **Color Contrast**: WCAG AA compliant (4.5:1 for normal text)
- **Focus States**: Clear visual indicators
- **Semantic HTML**: Proper heading hierarchy
- **Alt Text**: Descriptive text for images

